The project Partas.Nacara.Theme is a derivative work of Nacara.Theme.Default,
taken from the Nacara project named above. Its F# sources, stylesheets and
scripts were copied from that project and then modified. The modifications
include:

  - splitting the single embedded stylesheet into named CSS cascade layers
    that a consuming site can replace, drop or reorder
  - generating the entry stylesheet, which declares the cascade order, rather
    than embedding it
  - renaming the namespace, assembly and package from Nacara.Theme.Default to
    Partas.Nacara.Theme, so that a consumer referencing both does not get two
    assemblies claiming the same types

Files carrying those modifications are marked individually, as Section 4(b) of
the Apache License asks.

The other projects in this repository - Partas.Nacara.Theme.Contracts,
